# Third-party Unreal MCP reference repositories may contain Git LFS pointer-only
# test assets. Keep source/docs tracked, but do not commit missing binary test
# fixtures from cloned references.
# AirSim-family external references: keep source/Docs/configs, exclude local
# clones, build outputs, generated caches, and large compiled artifacts.
#
# Keep very large external/reference trees isolated by default. Already tracked
# files remain tracked; new files in these trees must be admitted with
# path-limited `git add -f <reviewed-slice>` after size/secret checks.
References/Agent/
!References/Agent/
References/Agent/*
# Keep Agent reference projects behind the parent throttle. Admit one reviewed
# project slice at a time with pathspec-based force-add; do not grow this
# file into a per-project index. Generic generated/dependency/archive/binary
# and local-only file classes are handled by the final References/** guard.
!References/Agent/Gateway/
!References/Agent/Gateway/**
!References/Agent/SDK/
!References/Agent/SDK/**
